ease verify it before including it.\n\nI found no ticket numbers in the other digests (3/10 and 7/7/2025, 12/1/2025, 5/3/2026, 8/3/2026, or the cheat sheet). The 8/3/2026 digest describes door-assignment problems at Hartford without a ticket number.\n\nI can only see these channels and files. Anything in the support system itself will be missing from this list."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
